#: ../../source/unzipper_README.md:46
msgid ""
"Extract emits the 'close' event once the zip's contents have been fully "
"extracted to disk. `Extract` uses "
"[fstream.Writer](https://www.npmjs.com/package/fstream) and therefore "
"needs need an absolute path to the destination directory.  This directory"
" will be automatically created if it doesn't already exits."
msgstr ""

