#: ../../source/unzipper_README.md:141
msgid ""
"`unzipper.parseOne([regex])` is a convenience method that unzips only one"
" file from the archive and pipes the contents down (not the entry "
"itself).  If no search criteria is specified, the first file in the "
"archive will be unzipped.  Otherwise, each filename will be compared to "
"the criteria and the first one to match will be unzipped and piped down."
"  If no file matches then the the stream will end without any content."
msgstr ""

